host Vultr SEA NixOS VPS ai-jail pier (Daylight DC-1 hand) -- Eastern (EDT)
title Caravan owe -- a concession the plan made reaches the run that comes after it
prompt Take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, Standfast on reds first, deep-read one council-rota doc, condense REMEMBER when a set completes, and send each finished increment as its own signed round.
think Standfast first: walked crux/REDS.md for open agent-closable reds. Every living row reads CLOSED -- %96 and %97 both closed on metal `20260820.030003` and `20260820.030440`, %81 closed, %83's prevention landed, %84 closed on measurement. %73 stays booked to the chunking-storage horizon by design rather than open. Nothing to halt the line, so constructive work was clear to begin.
think The running thread came off the newest log's recommend line rather than off the card. The avow rung had just landed, and its recommend named the next crux exactly: a supervisor may publish `the plan takes the finding, and says the work is owed another look` beside `carried out whole` every run forever, and nothing anywhere makes a conceded finding change one thing the next run does.
think Council rota, lap index 77 mod 27 = 23 -- context/specs/20260627-102012_one-clock-naming-law.md. Its two-tier law shaped this lap directly: living names for what is revised in place, dated stamps for the append-only stream. The new module takes a living name (`caravan/owe.rye`); the record of the lap takes a stamp read from the clock, never estimated.
think Named the rung under the Comlink tendency -- clear, fun, safe. Grepped the tree for `owe` as an identifier and found zero hits in .rye and .rish alike; it appears only in prose, including one line in avow.rye already calling that rung the one that finally asks the plan to owe something. The word says exactly what the act is and it was waiting.
think Shaped the rung around one honest asymmetry. Every note this arc keeps is a record *of* the run that wrote it -- what was lost, what was said, what a third hand made of it. A debt is the first note addressed forward, to a run that has not started, and that is precisely what makes a concession cost something: it is still there when the plan next opens its own notes.
think Held the other half of the avow rung's promise. Answering is not yielding, so a dissent books no debt -- booking one would turn holding one's ground into an admission of fault, make the honest answer the expensive one, and teach every supervisor to concede nothing. `OweUnconceded` is that guard, refused by name.
think Gave the debt two bytes rather than one. The finding echoed back exactly makes it answerable to a particular admission; the settlement it was conceded under is real information a later run needs, since a plan that said `carried out whole` while conceding owes a different look than one already reporting itself short.
think Built the rung the arc's way: owe.rye seeded from avow.rye, the avowing section converted to re-exports, a new Report layer wrapping avow's, every deeper accessor gaining one `.inner`, and the owing section written fresh. Six RED paths proven on metal before any GREEN claim.
obs The measurement moves and nothing else does. One plan of 6 phases run twice absorbs 3, loses 3, re-seats 3, spends 6 dependents, takes the same judgment back, posts and carries the same correction, reads the same reply, records the same disagreement, escorts the same word, asks the same reader, stands the same mark, tells the same raiser, carries the same position past itself, dates it to the same age of 4, publishes the same loud standing, carries the same case to the same third hand, reads back the same finding, concedes it in the same words either way, and settles carried either way -- while concessions booked as a debt the next run finds rise 0 to 1 and concessions a plan made that reach no run after them fall 1 to 0.
obs Both measured runs now concede, unlike the avow lap where one spoke and one stayed mute. That is what makes the parting honest: every number beneath this rung stands still under both marks, including the avowing itself at 1 and 1, and only the carrying forward moves.
obs The planted control is the honest part of the round. Disarm every guard at once -- the write skipped, the read-back dropped, and both harness reads of the debt replaced by the answer they hoped for -- and the selftest prints GREEN while caravan/.owes/plan.owe does not exist at all. An operator would believe a concession had been carried forward that reached nobody.
obs The debt on the wire reads `uc` in two bytes: the finding upheld for the reader who objected, and the outcome carried out whole. Read straight off caravan/.owes/plan.owe outside the run that wrote it, exactly as a later run would find it.
obs Both new functions came in under the tree-wide seventy without a split -- book_the_debt at 54 lines, check_owe at 61 -- and the past-70 roster is unchanged. TAME bans clean, width-check clean.
loom witness=caravan_owe_witness verdict=green red_paths=6 refusals=5 debt_bytes=2
loom suite=caravan_suite_witness rungs=77 verdict=green cold_tree=yes
file caravan/owe.rye the rung -- a concession booked as a debt that outlives the run that made it, five refusals by name
file tools/caravan_owe_witness.rish the witness -- GREEN on metal, six RED paths proven first, the debt read outside the run that wrote it
file tools/caravan_suite_witness.rish registers the new rung; the choir sings 77 in one voice
file caravan/README.md the durable per-rung record, so the card need not carry it
file crux/CAIRNS.md the walk-back before the card condensed, nib 8178a12701
file crux/REMEMBER.md the avow live edge folded to a pointer; the Now refilled with the owe rung
recommend keep-going the arc now corrects a record, carries the correction, hears the answer, records the disagreement, escorts the word, bounds the objection, stands its standing, tells the raiser, reads their reply, carries a live quarrel past the run that heard it, makes the inheriting run answer for it, lets its holder close it, says how long a standing one has stood, reads that age aloud, puts a long-standing one before a hand that is neither party, reads back what that hand made of it, makes the plan answer that finding on the record, and now carries the plan's own concession forward to the run after it -- so the question above is what that next run owes the debt it inherits: the arc leaves an admission standing where a later run will find it and gives that run no obligation whatever toward it, which means a plan may open every morning holding a debt it booked in good faith and settle `carried out whole` without ever once meeting it.
